    skos:definition "Non-visible optical radiation in the ultraviolet range, modeled as physical exposure. Any at-body delivery is bounded by the optical-radiation comfort boundary (sstim-ex:boundaryOpticalRadiation), which carries an exposure limit citing IEC 62471 / ICNIRP. BSC Lab does not currently deliver ultraviolet radiation at the body."@en ;
